# diagnostic-mode: compile
# expect-code: E2S179
# expect-span: byte 360
# #1559. A compiler-private byte-read carrier is not a Kofun source value.
# Binding it must be refused before C exists; the Bytes mutation gate covers
# the other seven operations and the remaining value contexts.
